{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"c":1,"w":0.72053634643554687,"t":"If you enjoy working with children, we have three vacancies for what are called 'playmates'.","x":0.069822121417272273,"y":0.082529433953973608,"h":0.020085521947557639},{"x":0.069755831083242209,"c":1,"t":"These volunteers help children learn about staying healthy through a range of out-of-school","y":0.098729692274809988,"w":0.72460932413736978,"h":0.022171096564081894},{"w":0.7381004333496094,"y":0.11582284128866549,"x":0.069787004930208049,"t":"activities. You don't need to have children yourself, but it's good if you know something about","h":0.020308813647689106,"c":1},{"x":0.071719343278196471,"y":0.1349009066780037,"w":0.31669848124186201,"c":1,"h":0.015689864114066143,"t":"nutrition and can give clear instructions."},{"y":0.15626005818338751,"h":0.019164727707146834,"t":"If that doesn't appeal to you, maybe you would be interested in helping out at our story club","w":0.72827702840169273,"x":0.069825342776343002,"c":1},{"w":0.74206527709960934,"h":0.022989031830309314,"x":0.06781512622811571,"c":1,"t":"for disabled children, especially if you have done some acting. We put on three performances","y":0.17113583249882991},{"x":0.06983996243902936,"w":0.66614980061848961,"h":0.018081537288297311,"c":1,"y":0.18983379561909652,"t":"a year based on books they have read and we're always looking for support with the"},{"y":0.20651212479969971,"t":"theatrical side of this.","w":0.17329865773518882,"h":0.017421708151558857,"c":1,"x":0.069672398066874267},{"x":0.069840072851527185,"y":0.22950652738254673,"w":0.73994069417317709,"h":0.019323017441223778,"c":1,"t":"The last area I'Il mention today is first aid. Volunteers who join this group can end up teaching"},{"c":1,"y":0.24563953475379419,"t":"others in vulnerable groups who may be at risk of injury. Initially, though, your priority will be","w":0.72427185058593757,"h":0.017441860686210009,"x":0.069902910243169358},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"w":0.58640777587890625,"c":1,"y":0.26292834882767169,"x":0.069902908427599844,"t":"to take in a lot of information and not forget any important steps or details."},{"t":"Right, so does anyone have any questions...","x":0.07368086158888891,"y":0.28808459384219876,"w":0.35939033508300777,"h":0.016000114274544841,"c":1},{"t":"PART 3","y":0.35015576344643429,"w":0.1029126230875651,"x":0.071844659234858221,"h":0.01466981763037567,"c":1},{"t":"HUGO:","h":0.011778669268171393,"x":0.071811127792971469,"y":0.38219206068914569,"w":0.04666900634765625,"c":1},{"h":0.012027242547626438,"c":1,"x":0.071784398088509574,"t":"CHANTAL:","w":0.068081690470377612,"y":0.39660265764704117},{"w":0.048543688456217454,"t":"HUGO:","h":0.011627906728013726,"y":0.41424418612615421,"c":1,"x":0.071844660603855429},{"t":"CHANTAL:","w":0.066047916412353525,"y":0.43018073849903748,"h":0.010278057680694452,"x":0.073772158764410872,"c":1},{"h":0.010273326743057587,"c":1,"x":0.073767133286808728,"y":0.46215984813002309,"w":0.046640491485595709,"t":"HUGO:"},{"x":0.071844660066224128,"t":"CHANTAL:","y":0.47965116251361395,"h":0.010174419129748813,"c":1,"w":0.067961165110270186},{"x":0.073786408152504424,"w":0.046601940790812174,"t":"HUGO:","y":0.51162790669207703,"h":0.010174419129748924,"c":1},{"h":0.011791318376487725,"t":"CHANTAL:","x":0.071819762811666549,"y":0.54352294544559243,"w":0.068010959625244144,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.048543688456217454,"t":"HUGO:","h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.55959302331557981,"x":0.071844660701772603},{"c":1,"h":0.00872093034310506,"x":0.07378640927773375,"y":0.59302325574546655,"w":0.066019414265950538,"t":"CHANTALY"},{"h":0.010320167898017707,"y":0.60748526471700781,"c":1,"w":0.046658624013264968,"t":"HUGO:","x":0.073758067150991924},{"x":0.071844660069079636,"t":"CHANTAL:","y":0.62499999972248876,"w":0.067961165110270172,"h":0.010174419129749035,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.011627906728013615,"y":0.65697674428618691,"t":"HUGO:","w":0.048543688456217454,"x":0.071844660533218127},{"y":0.67296511621016986,"x":0.075728155307478937,"c":1,"t":"CHANTAL:","w":0.064077669779459626,"h":0.00872093034310506},{"h":0.012115362054462286,"y":0.68870976080799351,"c":1,"x":0.073679391585330531,"w":0.046815973917643222,"t":"HUGO:"},{"t":"CHANTAL:","c":1,"w":0.066019414265950538,"y":0.70494186057186348,"h":0.011627906728013726,"x":0.07378640927773375},{"y":0.73672372626060167,"w":0.046795609792073561,"c":1,"t":"HUGO:","h":0.013471151809454684,"x":0.073689574135510916},{"t":"CHANTAL.","y":0.77034883714081548,"c":1,"h":0.00872093034310506,"x":0.075728156844665218,"w":0.06601941426595051},{"t":"HUGO:","x":0.073786408633720116,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1,"w":0.046601940790812188,"y":0.80087209277682825},{"w":0.066046485900878915,"t":"CHANTAL:","x":0.075714621757958789,"y":0.83425312866817047,"h":0.010272812174859425,"c":1},{"w":0.048543688456217426,"c":1,"t":"HUGO:","x":0.073786408563153397,"h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.86627906952101419},{"t":"Hi Chantal. What did you think of the talk, then?","w":0.37864077250162759,"h":0.01601372894096964,"c":1,"x":0.16893204103690379,"y":0.377881619786822},{"w":0.4213592274983724,"y":0.39532710264829207,"x":0.16893203663732284,"h":0.014641744548286595,"t":"Hi Hugo. I thought it was good once I'd moved seats.","c":1},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"y":0.40988372098699022,"w":0.44854370117187503,"t":"Oh - were the people beside you chatting or something?","x":0.16893203383639266,"c":1},{"x":0.16699030256164632,"t":"It wasn't that. I went early so that I'd get a seat and not have to stand, but then","c":1,"h":0.016003767352237852,"y":0.42585669764308787,"w":0.6213592020670573},{"w":0.39643987019856763,"h":0.017963482509149697,"c":1,"y":0.44171404976703421,"t":"this guy sat right in front of me and he was so tall!","x":0.16681940522919689},{"x":0.16893203913373531,"y":0.45784883710617619,"w":0.3747572835286459,"h":0.015988371899566145,"c":1,"t":"It's hard to see through people's heads, isn't it?"},{"t":"Impossible! Anyway, to answer your question, I thought it was really interesting,","y":0.47383177589560121,"w":0.63106796264648435,"x":0.16699029119514552,"h":0.017447293955960452,"c":1},{"x":0.16893203801247569,"h":0.014534884301301454,"t":"especially what the speaker said about the job market.","y":0.49273255784552428,"w":0.43106796264648439,"c":1},{"w":0.63717280069986981,"c":1,"x":0.1687959712864705,"t":"Me too. I mean we know we're going into a really competitive field so it's obvious","y":0.50601091922517638,"h":0.019136079449519894},{"w":0.26432469685872395,"t":"that we may struggle to get work.","y":0.52433300266133465,"c":1,"x":0.16878779046637418,"h":0.016297135991842238},{"w":0.48349512736002598,"t":"That's right - and we know we can't all have that 'dream job'.","h":0.017537853205315423,"x":0.16893205367435585,"y":0.5376947042325535,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Yeah, but it looks like there's a whole range of... areas of work that we hadn't","x":0.16883988016020698,"h":0.018192565775363212,"y":0.55495962807909494,"w":0.61960362752278642},{"c":1,"x":0.16893203012308441,"y":0.57258566955553303,"t":"even thought of - like fashion journalism, for instance.","w":0.42912623087565105,"h":0.014641744548286595},{"c":1,"x":0.17080958709200358,"w":0.40011398315429691,"t":"Yeah - I wasn't expecting so many career options.","y":0.58847933289811327,"h":0.015844229819990008},{"t":"Mmm. Overall, she had quite a strong message, didn't she?","x":0.16885336984000882,"y":0.60432086929926276,"w":0.47396113077799479,"c":1,"h":0.017764703506992552},{"y":0.62056074781039583,"c":1,"t":"She did. She kept saying things likeạiIknow you all think this, but... and then","w":0.61165049235026037,"h":0.016199376947040545,"x":0.16893203536761955},{"c":1,"t":"she'd tell us how it really is.","y":0.63800623066051121,"w":0.22135922749837239,"h":0.014641744548286595,"x":0.16893203663722156},{"x":0.16887100651408729,"y":0.65204928912126314,"h":0.016720487172729892,"t":"Perhaps she thinks students are a bit narrow-minded about the industry.","c":1,"w":0.57292083740234379},{"c":1,"y":0.67005813924142443,"x":0.16893205033894607,"h":0.01467706317842199,"t":"It was a bit harsh, though! We know it's a tough industry.","w":0.44660191853841147},{"c":1,"t":"Yeah - and we're only first years, after all. We've got a lot to learn.","x":0.16884747365419514,"y":0.68392176592737419,"h":0.017575846282863905,"w":0.52636342366536459},{"c":1,"y":0.69968073203023218,"t":"Exactly. Do you think our secondary-school education should have been more","w":0.61576934814453121,"x":0.1707610597220573,"h":0.01869055905446082},{"c":1,"w":0.13009708404541015,"y":0.71802325574452031,"t":"career-focused?","x":0.1708737899837674,"h":0.011627906728013726},{"y":0.73203921116125914,"w":0.64295257568359376,"c":1,"x":0.17076256370890064,"h":0.019704737915799631,"t":"Well, we had numerous talks on careers, which was good, but none of them were"},{"t":"very inspiring. They could have asked more people like today's speaker to talk to us.","y":0.74754309268976604,"x":0.1688017856952202,"h":0.019009839114370375,"w":0.64486063639322921,"c":1},{"x":0.16885332114816454,"h":0.017364112164743872,"c":1,"y":0.76473250898600764,"t":"I agree. We were told about lots of different careers - just when we needed to","w":0.61569346110026046},{"w":0.3807728576660156,"h":0.018126447921229971,"c":1,"x":0.17076703115101671,"t":"be, but not by the experts who really know stuff.","y":0.78187329973721786},{"y":0.79646341617370864,"w":0.64090031941731773,"x":0.17081040847116261,"c":1,"t":"So did today's talk influence your thoughts on what career you'd like to take up in","h":0.018348170366614069},{"w":0.089450785319010406,"y":0.81515401883390459,"h":0.01358731112376188,"x":0.16886684030356325,"c":1,"t":"the future?"},{"x":0.17077422820546928,"t":"Well. promised myself that I'd go through this course and keep an open mind till","h":0.017697079976399688,"w":0.64098775227864579,"y":0.82978403838760562,"c":1},{"w":0.070065466562906908,"y":0.84861612517745122,"h":0.014977051684418208,"x":0.16885076221532244,"t":"the end.","c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.86168580273597994,"x":0.17076104313636922,"w":0.64487513224283854,"t":"But I think it's better to pick an area of the industry now and then aim to get better","h":0.018131128946940134},{"h":0.013209990623212708,"t":"and better at it.","y":0.88068535816609284,"w":0.12233009338378908,"c":1,"x":0.17087378913334816},{"h":0.014648988907953742,"t":"Test 1","y":0.034883721210011709,"x":0.84271844666240692,"w":0.060194174448649052,"c":1},{"x":0.83495145687204209,"t":"Q18","w":0.038834950129191137,"h":0.014534883112922281,"y":0.11482558166110313,"c":1},{"w":0.040776697794596362,"x":0.83300970929687645,"t":"Q19","h":0.01744186068621012,"c":1,"y":0.15406976715689491},{"y":0.25985111355747925,"c":1,"t":"Q20","h":0.016634982100157014,"w":0.039305524826049765,"x":0.83471616953511352},{"x":0.83495145692884065,"t":"Q21","h":0.01308139551465759,"y":0.44186046499703169,"c":1,"w":0.036893202463785801},{"h":0.01308139551465759,"w":0.036893202463785912,"c":1,"x":0.83689320449626237,"t":"Q22","y":0.55523255801814997},{"t":"Q23","y":0.66715116267145025,"x":0.83689320444996762,"w":0.038834950129191137,"h":0.01308139551465759,"c":1},{"t":"Q24","y":0.73110465139412029,"x":0.83689320450822002,"w":0.038834950129191026,"h":0.014534883112922281,"c":1},{"x":0.83689320444996762,"y":0.82994186034586892,"w":0.038834950129191137,"c":1,"h":0.01308139551465759,"t":"Q25"},{"t":"101","x":0.86990291323412638,"w":0.036893202463785801,"c":1,"y":0.95203488398218461,"h":0.014534883112922281}]}